@startuml
!theme plain

top to bottom direction
skinparam state {
  FontSize 14
  Padding 12
}

title TASK-260715-1juybj — One CONNECT flow ownership state

[*] --> Authenticated : exclusive handoff
Authenticated --> Reserved : reserve flow + parser
Authenticated --> Terminal : stale | capacity
Reserved --> Parsing
Parsing --> Opening : valid CONNECT
Parsing --> Terminal : request failure
Opening --> Replying : channel owned
Opening --> Terminal : open failure
Replying --> Streaming : REP=00 sent
Replying --> Terminal : reply failure
Streaming --> HalfClosedLocal : local EOF
Streaming --> HalfClosedRemote : SSH EOF
HalfClosedLocal --> HalfClosedBoth : SSH EOF
HalfClosedRemote --> HalfClosedBoth : local EOF
HalfClosedBoth --> Terminal : graceful close
Streaming --> Terminal : abort
HalfClosedLocal --> Terminal : abort
HalfClosedRemote --> Terminal : abort
Terminal --> [*] : once-only cleanup

note left of Authenticated
  Boundary transfers the exclusive socket
  at the first CONNECT-request byte.
end note

note right of Opening
  One open attempt. A late channel after
  rejection, timeout, or cancellation closes.
end note

note right of Streaming
  Two independent pumps.
  One bounded buffer per direction.
  No side queue and no flow migration.
end note

note right of HalfClosedBoth
  Local EOF calls finishWriting once.
  SSH EOF calls local shutdown(SHUT_WR) once.
end note

note right of Terminal
  First terminal claimant fixes the reason.
  Cleanup joins tasks, closes owned handles,
  and releases reservations once. Late events
  cannot revive or double-release the flow.
end note

@enduml
